# What the public repository holds: the game's source (src/), its card data (data/), sounds and fonts (inside
# src/client), the app icon (build/), the tests and GitHub workflows, the build and lint configs, the README and
# the licences. Everything below is either rebuilt from those, private, or local to this computer.

# Installed packages and build output (npm ci, npm run build, npm run package)
node_modules/
dist/
release/

# Test and coverage output
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/

# Your own custom decks: the game keeps them in custom-decks/ when it runs from source
custom-decks/

# Private design and planning documents (they stay on this computer)
docs/
DESIGN.md
PRODUCT.md
.impeccable/

# Local tools and assistants
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
skills-lock.json
.superpowers/
.playwright-mcp/

# Logs, environment files and operating-system clutter
*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
